WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
Welcome to the Speaking Lab!

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.100
I'm Mr. Bennett, and I'm glad you're here.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.200
This site was built to help you
grow as a speaker,

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.750
build confidence, and find your voice.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.900
Together, we'll explore the skills
that help people

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.700
communicate with clarity,
purpose, and impact.
